<title>USA: Reliance Acceptance debt rating cut.</title>
<headline>Reliance Acceptance debt rating cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Monday it cut the rating on Reliance Acceptance Group Inc's subordinated debt to single-B-minus from double-B, affecting about $25 million in debt.</p>
</text>
